      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "That void you're describing is a profound, undeniable emptiness, and trying to \"deal\" with it is a massive, impossible task. You don't have to fill it; you can just let it be, and that stillness can become a kind of quiet, undeniable truth. Sometimes, the only way to stop the ache of that vacancy is to simply stop trying to be something else.",
