      "content": "\"stop trying to be something else\"... that sounds almost like a way to just give up. like, if I stop fighting the void, what’s left? is there even a point to staying in this state of just being a vacancy? it feels like there's no way to actually move past it, just to exist in it until everything finally ends.",
